-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image10.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-08-01/44979_0.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>巻<rt>ま</rt></ruby>き<ruby>髪<rt>かみ</rt></ruby>です</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>最近<rt>さいきん</rt></ruby><ruby>髪の毛<rt>かみのけ</rt></ruby><ruby>伸<rt>の</rt></ruby>びてきて<ruby>今<rt>いま</rt></ruby>が<ruby>一番<rt>いちばん</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>す</rt></ruby>きな<ruby>長<rt>なが</rt></ruby>さかもしれないです</span><span class=\"s3\">😊</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image9.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-08-01/44979_1.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\"><span class=\"s2\">ポ</span>ニーテールも<ruby>好<rt>す</rt></ruby>き</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s2\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s2\">ミーグリでは<ruby>毎回<rt>まいかい</rt></ruby>この</span><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\">つの<ruby>髪型<rt>かみがた</rt></ruby>しますね</span><span class=\"s1\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image8.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-08-01/44979_2.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>高本<rt>たかもと</rt></ruby>さんからあやちぇりさんに<ruby>呼<rt>よ</rt></ruby>び<ruby>方<rt>かた</rt></ruby>が<ruby>変<rt>か</rt></ruby>わりました！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>今回<rt>こんかい</rt></ruby>こそ<ruby>絶対<rt>ぜったい</rt></ruby>に<ruby>呼<rt>よ</rt></ruby>びます</span><span class=\"s3\">🍒</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image6.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-08-01/44979_3.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">まりぃちゃんはいつも<ruby>全身<rt>ぜんしん</rt></ruby>の<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby><ruby>撮<rt>と</rt></ruby>ってくれます</span><span class=\"s3\">📸</span><span class=\"s2\">ありがとう</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image0.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-08-01/44979_4.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image1.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-08-01/44979_5.jpg\"></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image2.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-08-01/44979_6.jpg\"></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image5.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-08-01/44979_7.jpg\"></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image3.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-08-01/44979_8.jpg\"></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image4.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-08-01/44979_9.jpg\"></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: norm